WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.505
A tilted world.

00:02.205 --> 00:07.359
The Earth leans over by twenty-three degrees, and keeps leaning the same way all year.

00:07.809 --> 00:16.919
Here the north is tipped towards the Sun: the Arctic has daylight round the clock, and the line between day and night crosses the map at a slant.

00:17.369 --> 00:20.479
That lean, and nothing else, makes the seasons.
